nd both declare reviewer context_reset_pct 0 and final_reviewer fresh. At adjudicator dial 0, assert no retained adjudication is planned, runner version is not read, argv and environment equal a fresh session's, no store is written, the loop plan is None, and no keep-warm is built. At reviewer dial 0, assert no review keep is planned or written. A missing, unreadable, non-numeric or boolean reviewer dial reads off and fresh; with the dial on, only a retained adjudication or a scoped review is kept, and persisted reads fresh while the reviewer percent is zero.\"","+method = \"Read the shipped policy file and its template: the template declares adjudicator context_reset_pct 0 and this repository declares the same adjudicator keys, and both declare reviewer context_reset_pct 0 and final_reviewer fresh. At adjudicator dial 0, assert no retained adjudication is planned, runner version is not read, argv and environment equal a fresh session's, no store is written, the loop plan is None, and no keep-warm is built. At reviewer dial 0, assert no review keep is planned or written. A missing, unreadable, non-numeric or boolean reviewer dial reads off and fresh; with the dial on, only a retained adjudication or a scoped review is kept, and persisted reads fresh while the reviewer percent is zero. A final reviewer that is neither fresh nor persisted, whether an invalid word or type, reads off and fresh even with a positive percent, and loop review draws then retain nothing.\""," tier = \"Smoke\""," expected = \"Satisfies LLR-270 (parents SR-227 and SR-239): the shipped dials are inert and share their declared structure; an off adjudicator dial has exactly fresh-session launch behavior and builds no warmer; malformed reviewer configuration fails closed to fresh review.\""," automated = \"Yes\""]},{"oldStart":3532,"oldLines":10,"newStart":3532,"newLines":10,"lines":[" [test.TC-351]"," verifies = [\"SR-222\", \"SR-227\", \"SR-238\", \"SR-239\", \"LLR-269\", \"LLR-270\", \"IF-247\", \"IF-248\"]"," level = \"Unit\"","-method = \"With reviewer retention on, drive iteration and final draws, separate lanes, malformed or misfiled scoped records, keep-warm, template changes, pin fallback, and loop handoff. Assert the empty scope retains its adjudicator filename, writer-produced variants reload, and logs record fresh or resumed mode and keep scope.\"","+method = \"With reviewer retention on, drive iteration and final draws, separate lanes, malformed or misfiled scoped records, keep-warm, template changes, pin fallback, and loop handoff. Assert the empty scope retains its adjudicator filename, writer-produced variants reload, and logs record fresh or resumed mode and keep scope; a live record whose optional occupancy, use or compaction field has a type its writer never produces reads as no record, and the next review round mints and bookkeeps a fresh session instead of resuming and raising.\""," tier = \"Smoke\""," expected = \"Satisfies SR-239 through LLR-269 and LLR-270: only its lane, claim, phase and stage resume; invalid or other-keyed state mints fresh; iteration and final reviewers remain separate; reviewer records are never warmed; and session-mode and keep-scope are recorded.\""," automated = \"Yes\"","-evidence = \"tests/test_session_keep.py::test_two_iteration_rounds_resume_one_review_session; tests/test_session_keep.py::test_a_second_lane_on_the_same_route_does_not_resume_the_first; tests/test_session_keep.py::test_the_empty_scope_keeps_the_adjudicators_file_name; tests/test_session_keep.py::test_a_record_naming_another_scope_reads_as_no_record; tests/test_session_keep.py::test_keep_warm_never_pings_a_reviewer_record; tests/test_session_keep.py::test_the_gating_round_in_fresh_mode_mints_fresh_and_retires_the_iteration; tests/test_session_keep.py::test_persisted_mode_resumes_only_the_final_reviewers_scope; tests/test_session_keep.py::test_a_lane_with_no_claim_base_retains_no_reviewer; tests/test_session_keep.py::test_the_loop_draw_pins_a_na